<title>USA: Chemical Leaman Corp sells $100 mln 144a snr notes.</title>
<headline>Chemical Leaman Corp sells $100 mln 144a snr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A private placement issue from Chemical Leaman Corp was priced on Tuesday via Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Chemical Leaman is a truck carriage company.</p>
<p>BORROWER CHEMICAL LEAMAN CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10.375 PCT MATURITY 6/15/2005</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.50   FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 10.457 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 329 BPS    CALLABLE NON CALL FOUR</p>
<p>NOTE: THREE-YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 25 PERCENT AT 110.375.</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
